---
---

<section id="pipeline" class="section pipeline-section">
      <div class="section-label">The Workflow</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">
        From PDF to <span class="grad-text">Mastery</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="section-sub">
        Five automated stages. Zero manual scheduling. One cohesive pipeline.
      </p>

      <div class="pipeline">
        <div class="pipeline-line" aria-hidden="true"></div>

        <div class="pipe-step">
          <div class="pipe-num">01</div>
          <div class="pipe-content">
            <h4>Upload & Configure</h4>
            <p>
              Upload your PDF to Supabase Storage. Set your available study
              hours, preferred days, and target completion date. That's your
              last manual input.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pipe-step">
          <div class="pipe-num">02</div>
          <div class="pipe-content">
            <h4>n8n Webhook Trigger</h4>
            <p>
              Upload fires a webhook into n8n. The workflow extracts raw text,
              passes it to an AI agent, and receives a structured JSON array of
              daily learning objectives.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pipe-step">
          <div class="pipe-num">03</div>
          <div class="pipe-content">
            <h4>Google Calendar Injection</h4>
            <p>
              n8n maps objectives to your available time slots and pushes them
              as Google Calendar events. Each event carries its full sub-topic
              description.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pipe-step">
          <div class="pipe-num">04</div>
          <div class="pipe-content">
            <h4>Quiz Unlock & Assessment</h4>
            <p>
              When a calendar block ends, its quiz unlocks. n8n generates
              context-specific MCQ, Enumeration, and Identification questions.
              Your React frontend renders them with live feedback.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pipe-step">
          <div class="pipe-num">05</div>
          <div class="pipe-content">
            <h4>Progression & Rank Update</h4>
            <p>
              Quiz accuracy and streak length feed into Elo calculation. Your
              rank updates automatically. Missed a 24-hour window? Combo resets
              — stay consistent or pay the price.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

<style>
/* ── PIPELINE ── */
  .pipeline-section {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .pipeline {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0;
  }

  .pipeline-line {
    position: absolute;
    left: 27px;
    top: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    width: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(
      to bottom,
      var(--indigo),
      var(--violet),
      transparent
    );
    opacity: 0.3;
  }

  .pipe-step {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    padding: 1.75rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateX(-16px);
    transition:
      opacity 0.5s,
      transform 0.5s;
  }

  .pipe-step:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }
  .pipe-step.revealed {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateX(0);
  }

  .pipe-num {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--indigo);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid rgba(123, 92, 245, 0.3);
    border-radius: 0.4rem;
    width: 54px;
    height: 36px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .pipe-content h4 {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .pipe-content p {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .pipe-step { gap: 1rem; padding: 1.25rem 0; }
    .pipe-num { width: 44px; height: 32px; font-size: 0.68rem; }
    .pipeline-line { left: 22px; }
    .pipe-content h4 { font-size: 0.95rem; }
    .pipe-content p { font-size: 0.85rem; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .pipe-step { gap: 0.85rem; }
    .pipe-num { width: 38px; height: 28px; font-size: 0.65rem; border-radius: 0.3rem; }
    .pipeline-line { left: 19px; }
  }
</style>